<title>USA: Shoe Carnival Feb same-store sales fall.</title>
<headline>Shoe Carnival Feb same-store sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>EVANSVILLE, Ind. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shoe Carnival Inc, a retailer of footwear and accessories, said Wednesday its same-store sales for the four weeks ended March 1 declined 0.8 percent from a year earlier.</p>
<p>It said total sales for the period decreased 2.6 percent, to $16 million from $16.5 million for the four weeks ended March 2, 1996.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
